{
  "format": "cp-stages/1",
  "spec_tag": "spec-1.0",
  "about": [
    "The structure of every problem P01-P16 as its problem file states it: sub-problems, the instances a harness runs (sizes, orders, answer modes), and for each stage its number, a description, the queries it poses with their answer caps, whether it commits (P11) and whether it spawns computations (P09, P16b), with the line of the problem file where it is stated.",
    "This file holds NO constants and NO valid outcomes. Descriptions are paraphrased from the problem files with every constant of the stage information written as a placeholder: <k> for an integer, <atom> for an atom, <seq> for a sequence of values, <facts> for a set of facts. The program holds the stage information (PROTOCOL.md, Writing a program, rule 6); the harness knows only the structure here. Sizes n and arrival orders are structure, not constants: the problem files fix them, and the hidden variants do not vary them (variants/README.md).",
    "Lines are 1-based line numbers in the problem file at spec-1.0. A stage's line is where its information is stated; a query's cap is stated by the problem where 'cap_line' is given, and otherwise follows PROTOCOL.md ('cap is 1 for an any one query and 20 otherwise').",
    "A query whose cap is null takes 'answers' and 'cap' from the parameters of the instance being run (P12)."
  ],
  "vocabulary": {
    "kind": {
      "adds": "the stage adds information (SPECIFICATION.md, Stages and monotonicity)",
      "replaces": "a replacing stage: a named quantity takes a new value (P10, P15d)",
      "retracts": "a retracting stage: information given earlier is withdrawn (P10d)",
      "commit": "a commit stage (P11): the system selects one current outcome v, and x = v is added",
      "query": "a problem of one stage, posed as a query"
    },
    "answers": {
      "all": "answers(20)",
      "any-one": "answers(1)"
    },
    "computation": "'main' is the one computation of the instance, or its top level; other ids are computations started with spawn(), named as the problem file names them",
    "limits": "budget_steps is per stage and per computation, in the system's own unit; a reposed run's budget is its measured restart cost plus budget_steps (PROTOCOL.md, Running). safety_limit_s is per stage; rerun_limit_s is the single rerun's limit, or null where the problem fixes the limit and forbids raising it"
  },
  "default_limits": {
    "budget_steps": 1000000,
    "safety_limit_s": 60,
    "rerun_limit_s": 600,
    "source": "PROTOCOL.md, Running"
  },
  "problems": [
    {
      "problem": "P01",
      "file": "problems/01-unknown-equality.md",
      "title": "Unknown equality",
      "effects": false,
      "subproblems": [
        {
          "id": "P01a", "line": 15, "title": "A chain of equations",
          "unknowns": ["x", "y", "z"], "readings": [],
          "instances": [{"id": "P01a", "parameters": {}}],
          "stages": [
            {"stage": 1, "line": 19, "kind": "adds", "description": "x = y", "queries": [{"id": "q", "computation": "main", "answers": "all", "cap": 20}], "commit": false, "spawns": []},
            {"stage": 2, "line": 20, "kind": "adds", "description": "y = z", "queries": [{"id": "q", "computation": "main", "answers": "all", "cap": 20}], "commit": false, "spawns": []},
            {"stage": 3, "line": 21, "kind": "adds", "description": "z = <k>", "queries": [{"id": "q", "computation": "main", "answers": "all", "cap": 20}], "commit": false, "spawns": []}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "P01b", "line": 23, "title": "An unknown inside a structure",
          "unknowns": ["s", "t"], "readings": [],
          "instances": [{"id": "P01b", "parameters": {}}],
          "stages": [
            {"stage": 1, "line": 27, "kind": "adds", "description": "conc(<seq>, s, t)", "queries": [{"id": "q", "computation": "main", "answers": "all", "cap": 20}], "commit": false, "spawns": []},
            {"stage": 2, "line": 28, "kind": "adds", "description": "s = <seq>", "queries": [{"id": "q", "computation": "main", "answers": "all", "cap": 20}], "commit": false, "spawns": []}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "P01c", "line": 30, "title": "A self-referential equation",
          "unknowns": ["x"], "readings": ["finite (line 38)", "rational (line 39)"],
          "instances": [{"id": "P01c", "parameters": {}}],
          "stages": [
            {"stage": 1, "line": 34, "kind": "query", "description": "x = <seq> ++ x", "queries": [{"id": "q", "computation": "main", "answers": "all", "cap": 20}], "commit": false, "spawns": []}
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "problem": "P02",
      "file": "problems/02-late-information.md",
      "title": "Late information",
      "effects": false,
      "notes": ["R1, R2 and R3 are the problem's names for its three relations (lines 11-13); they are labels, not constants."],
      "subproblems": [
        {
          "id": "P02a", "line": 15, "title": "In Elcock's order",
          "unknowns": ["u", "v", "w"], "readings": [],
          "instances": [{"id": "P02a", "parameters": {}}],
          "stages": [
            {"stage": 1, "line": 19, "kind": "adds", "description": "R1: u + v = <k>", "queries": [{"id": "q", "computation": "main", "answers": "all", "cap": 20}], "commit": false, "spawns": []},
            {"stage": 2, "line": 20, "kind": "adds", "description": "R2: w * u = v", "queries": [{"id": "q", "computation": "main", "answers": "all", "cap": 20}], "commit": false, "spawns": []},
            {"stage": 3, "line": 21, "kind": "adds", "description": "R3: u + <k> = <k>", "queries": [{"id": "q", "computation": "main", "answers": "all", "cap": 20}], "commit": false, "spawns": []}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "P02b", "line": 27, "title": "Every order",
          "unknowns": ["u", "v", "w"], "readings": [],
          "instances": [
            {"id": "P02b.R1R2R3", "parameters": {"order": ["R1", "R2", "R3"]}},
            {"id": "P02b.R1R3R2", "parameters": {"order": ["R1", "R3", "R2"]}},
            {"id": "P02b.R2R1R3", "parameters": {"order": ["R2", "R1", "R3"]}},
            {"id": "P02b.R2R3R1", "parameters": {"order": ["R2", "R3", "R1"]}},
            {"id": "P02b.R3R1R2", "parameters": {"order": ["R3", "R1", "R2"]}},
            {"id": "P02b.R3R2R1", "parameters": {"order": ["R3", "R2", "R1"]}}
          ],
          "stages": [
            {"stage": 1, "line": 29, "kind": "adds", "description": "the first relation of the instance's order", "queries": [{"id": "q", "computation": "main", "answers": "all", "cap": 20}], "commit": false, "spawns": []},
            {"stage": 2, "line": 29, "kind": "adds", "description": "the second relation of the instance's order", "queries": [{"id": "q", "computation": "main", "answers": "all", "cap": 20}], "commit": false, "spawns": []},
            {"stage": 3, "line": 29, "kind": "adds", "description": "the third relation of the instance's order", "queries": [{"id": "q", "computation": "main", "answers": "all", "cap": 20}], "commit": false, "spawns": []}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "P02c", "line": 42, "title": "All at once",
          "unknowns": ["u", "v", "w"], "readings": [],
          "instances": [{"id": "P02c", "parameters": {}}],
          "stages": [
            {"stage": 1, "line": 44, "kind": "query", "description": "R1, R2 and R3 as one stage, in that order", "queries": [{"id": "q", "computation": "main", "answers": "all", "cap": 20}], "commit": false, "spawns": []}
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "problem": "P03",
      "file": "problems/03-reversible-relations.md",
      "title": "Reversible relations",
      "effects": false,
      "subproblems": [
        {"id": "P03a", "line": 23, "title": "conc, forwards", "unknowns": ["c"], "readings": [], "instances": [{"id": "P03a", "parameters": {}}],
         "stages": [{"stage": 1, "line": 23, "kind": "query", "description": "conc(<seq>, <seq>, c)", "queries": [{"id": "q", "computation": "main", "answers": "all", "cap": 20}], "commit": false, "spawns": []}]},
        {"id": "P03b", "line": 24, "title": "conc, splitting", "unknowns": ["a", "b"], "readings": [], "instances": [{"id": "P03b", "parameters": {}}],
         "stages": [{"stage": 1, "line": 24, "kind": "query", "description": "conc(a, b, <seq>)", "queries": [{"id": "q", "computation": "main", "answers": "all", "cap": 20}], "commit": false, "spawns": []}]},
        {"id": "P03c", "line": 25, "title": "conc, suffix", "unknowns": ["b"], "readings": [], "instances": [{"id": "P03c", "parameters": {}}],
         "stages": [{"stage": 1, "line": 25, "kind": "query", "description": "conc(<seq>, b, <seq>)", "queries": [{"id": "q", "computation": "main", "answers": "all", "cap": 20}], "commit": false, "spawns": []}]},
        {"id": "P03d", "line": 26, "title": "conc, prefix", "unknowns": ["a"], "readings": [], "instances": [{"id": "P03d", "parameters": {}}],
         "stages": [{"stage": 1, "line": 26, "kind": "query", "description": "conc(a, <seq>, <seq>)", "queries": [{"id": "q", "computation": "main", "answers": "all", "cap": 20}], "commit": false, "spawns": []}]},
        {"id": "P03e", "line": 27, "title": "rev, forwards", "unknowns": ["b"], "readings": [], "instances": [{"id": "P03e", "parameters": {}}],
         "stages": [{"stage": 1, "line": 27, "kind": "query", "description": "rev(<seq>, b)", "queries": [{"id": "q", "computation": "main", "answers": "all", "cap": 20}], "commit": false, "spawns": []}]},
        {"id": "P03f", "line": 28, "title": "rev, backwards", "unknowns": ["a"], "readings": [], "instances": [{"id": "P03f", "parameters": {}}],
         "stages": [{"stage": 1, "line": 28, "kind": "query", "description": "rev(a, <seq>)", "queries": [{"id": "q", "computation": "main", "answers": "all", "cap": 20}], "commit": false, "spawns": []}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "problem": "P04",
      "file": "problems/04-unbounded-alternative.md",
      "title": "Unbounded alternative",
      "effects": false,
      "subproblems": [
        {"id": "P04a", "line": 32, "title": "loop first", "unknowns": ["x"], "readings": [], "instances": [{"id": "P04a", "parameters": {}}],
         "stages": [{"stage": 1, "line": 32, "kind": "query", "description": "loop(x) or x = <k>, in that order", "queries": [{"id": "q", "computation": "main", "answers": "all", "cap": 20}], "commit": false, "spawns": []}]},
        {"id": "P04b", "line": 33, "title": "loop second", "unknowns": ["x"], "readings": [], "instances": [{"id": "P04b", "parameters": {}}],
         "stages": [{"stage": 1, "line": 33, "kind": "query", "description": "x = <k> or loop(x), in that order", "queries": [{"id": "q", "computation": "main", "answers": "all", "cap": 20}], "commit": false, "spawns": []}]},

